      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "By 115 arthrographies of the wrist in patients with posttraumatic pain, the importance of the method for diagnosis in injured patients is discussed. It was possible to detect 29 cases with a lesion of the articular disc, 4 patients with ruptured radiocarpal joint and 3 cases with an injury of the distal radioulnar joint. The technique of filling the wrist is described and different manifestations of \"normal\" arthrogramms are exhibited."},
